## 1b. Platform eval order (Aug 4 2026)

1. **Agent Judge (Quality Check)** first — if it fails, Difficulty does **not** run  
2. Marker: `Blocked at the agentic judge. Not run: difficulty screen…` → revise Judge only  
3. Revision bar: every Agent Judge axis **≥ 3.5** (fix “3 with reservations”); `discuss (overreach)` → P-011  
4. After Judge passes: Difficulty = **4 trials/model**; worse model still **≤50%** pass rate  
5. Patterns: `P-010` (Judge before Difficulty), `P-011` (overreach / ≥3.5)

